WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,590 --> 00:00:08,350
Dad, go uphill

2
00:00:08,510 --> 00:00:09,790
You can't come down and take two steps

3
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:12,220
Let your son take a break

4
00:00:12,780 --> 00:00:14,340
Who said your father has bad legs and feet?

5
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:21,600
But although my father’s legs and feet are not good,

6
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:26,860
This crutch can also hit people. Yesterday, people talked too much and didn't show their bones.

7
00:00:27,350 --> 00:00:28,790
The knife wound on Black Shrimp's chest

8
00:00:28,910 --> 00:00:32,740
Did you stab it with a bayonet? I saw it

9
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:34,940
Several bullet holes are no longer vital

10
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:37,020
The last blow was to the heart

11
00:00:37,480 --> 00:00:39,790
You had an affair with him, Dad

12
00:00:40,150 --> 00:00:41,670
The black bear was shot twice and still charged up

13
00:00:41,870 --> 00:00:42,830
I didn't have time to shoot again

14
00:00:42,950 --> 00:00:44,110
He held it with a bayonet

15
00:00:44,430 --> 00:00:51,610
You hurry up and get into your bones

16
00:00:52,090 --> 00:00:53,370
Don't be so fierce next time

17
00:00:55,310 --> 00:00:56,950
Never mistake luck for strength

18
00:00:57,390 --> 00:00:58,750
Although you have only been in the mountains a few times

19
00:00:59,270 --> 00:01:00,230
Just shot the wild boar

20
00:01:00,390 --> 00:01:01,590
Pao Zi Black Shrimp Zi

21
00:01:02,740 --> 00:01:05,540
I also lost the leopard and it’s not right.

22
00:01:05,860 --> 00:01:06,780
Tell dad the truth

23
00:01:07,100 --> 00:01:08,180
Your ability to run mountains

24
00:01:08,420 --> 00:01:09,340
Who did you learn it from?

25
00:01:13,860 --> 00:01:15,260
My grandpa secretly taught me this when I was a child.

26
00:01:15,620 --> 00:01:17,540
His old man passed on all the mountain running secretaries to me.

27
00:01:19,060 --> 00:01:20,340
Grandpa, I'm sorry

28
00:01:20,780 --> 00:01:22,060
Old man Guo Ning should carry it on his back.

29
00:01:22,380 --> 00:01:24,460
Anyway, the fire-headed grass is open, what are you talking about?

30
00:01:24,940 --> 00:01:25,940
The old man passed it on to you

31
00:01:26,140 --> 00:01:27,340
What about me?

32
00:01:33,270 --> 00:01:34,310
I really didn't expect that

33
00:01:34,590 --> 00:01:35,870
You actually hid something secret from me

34
00:01:37,300 --> 00:01:38,380
Dad, please stop howling

35
00:01:39,020 --> 00:01:40,300
Grandpa also hid something secret from me.

36
00:01:40,700 --> 00:01:48,580
Qisha Qin Dingshu didn’t teach me, so it’s my father, you see.

37
00:01:48,780 --> 00:01:50,100
Can you pass the Qisha Qin Ding tree to me?

38
00:01:50,580 --> 00:01:57,240
If I encounter a fierce animal in the mountains, I can defend myself and I will teach you three tricks when I go home. Remember

39
00:01:57,520 --> 00:01:58,640
Unless life is in danger

40
00:01:58,760 --> 00:02:00,000
Otherwise, it must not be used on humans

41
00:02:00,320 --> 00:02:04,980
Just don't worry
